# Ruleset: official package registries
#
# Expects a proxy policy.
#
# A generic download set mixes domestic mirrors, GitHub Pages indexes that stall on the direct path, and destinations the GFW blocks. This file owns the official registries so their policy is explicit. Blocked destinations such as gcr.io, pkg.dev, mega.nz and archive.org stay unclassified so FINAL carries them to a proxy.
#
# Policy is a proxy because the direct path from the mainland answers slowly and can time out, which package managers feel on every metadata request.
#
# Scope: the package body or index host of an official registry, a Linux distribution's package archive, or a toolchain's official download host. Website, documentation, and static-asset hosts stay out and reach FINAL. GitHub-hosted registries stay in GitHub/GitHub.list. Chinese mirrors stay on the domestic path. Docker Hub stays in Library/Developer/Docker.list. NuGet stays in Library/Platforms/Microsoft.list.

# PyPI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pypi.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pythonhosted.org

# crates.io. Includes the sparse index and the static.crates.io crate files.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crates.io

# Yarn. Yarn Classic still publishes from this zone. Modern Yarn uses the npm registry.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yarnpkg.com

# Node.js. nodejs.org serves its site and its dist from one host.
DOMAIN,nodejs.org

# Rust
DOMAIN,static.rust-lang.org

# Debian. debian.map.fastlydns.net is the Fastly name behind deb.debian.org, which some clients dial directly.
DOMAIN,deb.debian.org
DOMAIN,security.debian.org
DOMAIN,debian.map.fastlydns.net

# RubyGems
DOMAIN,rubygems.org
DOMAIN,index.rubygems.org

# Maven Central
DOMAIN,repo1.maven.org
DOMAIN,repo.maven.apache.org

# Packagist
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,packagist.org

# Hex
DOMAIN,repo.hex.pm

# CocoaPods
DOMAIN,cdn.cocoapods.org

# Anaconda
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,repo.anaconda.com

# kernel.org
DOMAIN,cdn.kernel.org

# Electron
DOMAIN,artifacts.electronjs.org

# Linux Containers
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,images.linuxcontainers.org

# Ubuntu
DOMAIN,archive.ubuntu.com
DOMAIN,security.ubuntu.com
DOMAIN,ports.ubuntu.com

# Alpine Linux
DOMAIN,dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org

# Go modules. Exact hosts only: DOMAIN-SUFFIX golang.org would steal pkg.go.dev from the global classification.
DOMAIN,proxy.golang.org
DOMAIN,sum.golang.org
DOMAIN,index.golang.org

# React Native. Android artifacts publish from a Maven repository of its own.
DOMAIN,repo.reactnative.dev

# npm. Exact hosts only: DOMAIN-SUFFIX npmjs.org would steal www.npmjs.com and api.npmjs.org from the global classification.
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.com
DOMAIN,skimdb.npmjs.com
DOMAIN,replicate.npmjs.com
